---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { config } from '../lib/config';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Makeatimer is a free collection of browser-based timers and time calculators, operated by FAXCORP."
  path="/about/"
>
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Makeatimer</p>
    <h1>
      A little less time
      <br />
      doing time maths.
    </h1>
    <p>
      Makeatimer brings timers and practical time calculations together in one
      place. Start a countdown, total a working week, compare dates, or check a
      meeting time across cities.
    </p>
    <p>
      The tools run in your browser. There are no accounts, subscriptions, or
      calculation servers. Inputs can be shared through editable links.
    </p>
    <h2 id="open-source">Open source</h2>
    <p>
      The application is licensed under the MIT license, which lets you inspect,
      modify, and reuse the code. The tools are free to use.
    </p>
    <h2>Operator</h2>
    <p>
      Makeatimer is operated by {config.operator}.{' '}
      <a href="https://faxcorp.dev/company/">Company details</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Questions or a calculation that looks wrong?{' '}
      <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
